  id: preset-stone
  displayName: Stonewarden (Earth + Wind)
  playstyle: elemental
  description: 'Objective: control the enemy''s turn. Tremor staggers (the next attack loses a step), Stone Wall eats the busiest lane, Quake Slam cracks the enemy for melee. Cyclone''s Wind hits extend marks; Tailwind makes the next ability cheaper after it. Aftershock echoes Earth damage; Attunement rewards mixing elements. Gale Step (dodge) waits in reserve.

    Trade-off: bosses resist stagger after their limit; the wall only covers one lane.'
